## Summary of changes

**`ds-nav.css`** — 31 lines added:
- **2-column price list**: `.price-list-group .price-list` gets `display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:4px 32px`. The6 items lay out in 2 columns × 3 rows. Neutralised the negative left margin on anchors so items don't overlap grid cell edges.
- **Horizontal CTA band**: `.smallbiz-cta-band` — `grid-column:1/-2`, flex row, vertically centred, heading+text on left, amber CTA + "See Clarity" link on right. Overrides MegaRail's card styling for this instance only (scoped class).
- **Mobile (≤1100px)**: `.price-list-group` and `.smallbiz-cta-band` set to `grid-column:auto` for single-column stacking. CTA band switches to `flex-direction:column`.

**`Header.tsx`** — 12 lines added/changed:
- Replaced `<MegaRail>` for the smallbiz panel with inline `<div className="smallbiz-cta-band">` containing the same wording (heading, note, amber CTA, See Clarity link) in a horizontal flex layout. MegaRail component itself untouched.

**Net effect**: The panel should close up to ~420-500px on desktop with no large empty regions. The "Bigger than £500k?" block is now a compact horizontal band instead of a tall card with dead space. No other panels affected.
